Steps to configure Netflowv9
1. Flow RECORD

ex.
conf t
 flow record FLOW_RECORD
  match ipv4 source address
  match ipv4 destination address
  match transport source-port
  match transport destination-port
  match ipv4 protocol
  match ipv4 version
  collect counter bytes
  collect counter packets
  end


2. Flow EXPORTER

ex.
conf t
 flow exporter FLOW_EXPORTER
  destination __.__.__.__
  transport udp 2055
  export-protocol netflow-v9
  end


3. Flow MONITOR
- RECORD + EXPORTER

conf t
 flow monitor FLOW_MONITOR
  record FLOW_RECORD
  exporter FLOW_EXPORTER
  end

4. Apply Flow MONITOR to INTERFACE

conf t
 int range e0/0-3
  ip flow monitor FLOW_MONITOR input
  ip flow monitor FLOW_MONITOR output
  end
